      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<p>Maciek is a Cloud Engineer at VirtusLab with over five years of experience. He started out as a tester, maintaining the test environment at AWS. Later, he took the role of an administrator, managing company servers and resources in public clouds. Then he worked as a developer in a team creating tooling for ~ 1000 users, Currently, he is creating the IaaC platform on Azure.</p>"
